                            sling:resourceType="aem-bootcamp/components/general/text"
                            text="&lt;p>&amp;quot;An unforgettable experience! The mountain climbing expedition was challenging yet rewarding. The guides were knowledgeable and supportive throughout the journey.&amp;quot;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;h3>Sarah M.&lt;/h3>&#xd;&#xa;"
